# --- Java / Maven (apps/api) ---
target/
*.class
*.jar
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
HELP.md

# --- Tests y cobertura ---
coverage/
.nyc_output/
site/jacoco/

# --- Logs ---
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

